DLINE literature review was conducted using the following search criteria\"},\n{\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Administrative vaccination coverage data are derived from the country’s immunization registry system.\"},\n{\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The coverage is calculated by dividing the total number of doses administered by the estimated target population for vaccination.\"}\n],\n\"confidence\": \"medium\",\n\"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}